/-!
# Unconditional original-prime avoidance at the constructed rank cutoff

Every original chart at or above the cutoff is wholly complete. Its full good
relation open is therefore the whole relation, so the scalar 1 avoids every bad
locus. This proves full original localized source lifting without a valuation
regularity hypothesis. Smaller frame sizes remain a separate geometric problem.
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section
